# Only what building h2live takes goes to Docker (see Dockerfile.live): its
# crates' sources and the workspace's manifests. No map files, no build
# output, nothing else.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/*/Cargo.toml
!crates/blam-cache/src
!crates/wma/src
!crates/h2sim/src
!crates/h2net/src
!crates/h2live/src
**/*.map
